{
    "title": "Noovie Trivia",
    "description": "Level up your movie obsession with Noovie Trivia! \r\n\r\nThe trivia game with the most movie trivia.  Noovie Trivia has three engaging movie trivia games to test your movie knowledge with both theatrical and streaming films.\r\n\r\nTake on other movie fans in multiplayer mode or play solo for hours in quest mode. \r\n\r\nEven invite your friends to compete weekly on your leaderboard. Play the Daily Quiz every day to test yourself with new questions that pay out big rewards.\r\n\r\nThe more you play, the more Popcorn points you earn to increase your player level. Cash in your Popcorn on exclusive content like Player Avatars and future exclusive content.\r\n\r\nProve you\u2019re the movie master. Start playing today!\r\n\r\n\r\nAs more fully described in the National CineMedia Consumer Privacy Policy, available at https://www.noovie.com/privacy, We use your Personal Information to (i) provide a more meaningful experience to You when You use or access the NCM Properties or interact with Us, and (ii) deliver targeted advertising to You, including on behalf of our clients. This app uses technologies that automatically collect information about activity on the app to enhance user experience, analyze performance, and facilitate sharing of that information with our social media, advertising, and analytics partners.  By downloading this app, You agree to the (a) National CineMedia Consumer Privacy Policy, which describes the Personal Information We collect, record, store, use, disclose, sell, and/or share and your rights regarding that Personal Information, and (b) Terms of Use, available at https://www.noovie.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Level up your movie obsession with Noovie Trivia! <br><br>The trivia game with the most movie trivia.  Noovie Trivia has three engaging movie trivia games to test your movie knowledge with both theatrical and streaming films.<br><br>Take on other movie fans in multiplayer mode or play solo for hours in quest mode. <br><br>Even invite your friends to compete weekly on your leaderboard. Play the Daily Quiz every day to test yourself with new questions that pay out big rewards.<br><br>The more you play, the more Popcorn points you earn to increase your player level. Cash in your Popcorn on exclusive content like Player Avatars and future exclusive content.<br><br>Prove you\u2019re the movie master. Start playing today!<br><br><br>As more fully described in the National CineMedia Consumer Privacy Policy, available at https://www.noovie.com/privacy, We use your Personal Information to (i) provide a more meaningful experience to You when You use or access the NCM Properties or interact with Us, and (ii) deliver targeted advertising to You, including on behalf of our clients. This app uses technologies that automatically collect information about activity on the app to enhance user experience, analyze performance, and facilitate sharing of that information with our social media, advertising, and analytics partners.  By downloading this app, You agree to the (a) National CineMedia Consumer Privacy Policy, which describes the Personal Information We collect, record, store, use, disclose, sell, and/or share and your rights regarding that Personal Information, and (b) Terms of Use, available at https://www.noovie.com/terms",
